  "caption": "Taiwanese folk black metal. Tremolo-picked electric guitars at high speed, blast-beat drumming with double kick, erhu carrying the lead melody over the storm, suona taking the chorus lead with its piercing double-reed cut, bass locked to the guitars, pentatonic and Taiwanese minor-mode melodies throughout. Extreme and dense with the folk instruments leading rather than decorating. Male vocal growled and screamed through the verses and chorus, with a clean low chant in a slower bridge section. 184 BPM, E minor in a Taiwanese minor mode. Not fighting the sky, negotiating with it. No clean pop vocal, no synth, no autotune, no enka-style weeping, no key change.",
